# Hero video renditions (~40MB). They are served from NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE_URL, not from
# the repo: 40MB of binaries in git is paid for on every clone, every CI checkout and every
# deployment bundle, forever, because git never forgets a blob. Masters stay on disk here and
# are pushed with `node scripts/upload-hero-media.mjs`.
# See app/public/videos/README.md.
app/public/videos/*.mp4
